  "worked_solution": "The norm of a vector $v$ with respect to an inner product $\u27e8\\cdot ,\\cdot \u27e9$ is defined as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2016v\u2016=\\sqrt{\u27e8v,v\u27e9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComputing $\u2016v\u2016$ using our definition, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u2016v\u2016 & =\\sqrt{\u27e8v,v\u27e9} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2\\cdot (1\\cdot 1)+3\\cdot ((-2)\\cdot (-2))+2\\cdot ((-1)\\cdot (-1))} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{2+12+2} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{16} \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
